.TE
.PP
Colours, all
.IR colour :
.TS
tab(|);
lb lb lb
l l l.
key|default|used for
background|0x0c0f13ff|what shows in the gaps
frame|0x12161dff|window background
frame_focus|0x161b23ff|focused window background
border_color|0x222a35ff|unfocused border
accent|0xe6a54bff|focused border and header text
accent_soft|0xe6a54b4d|the 1px ring inside the focused border
